<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Enrollment Confirmation</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f8f8f8;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 30px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .title {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      .section-title {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6em;
        color: #333;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #666;
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="title">📩 WEL.X – Enrollment Confirmation</div>

      <p>
        <strong>Subject:</strong> Welcome to WEL.X – Your Enrollment is
        Confirmed!
      </p>
      <h3 class="section-title">Payment Status</h3>

      <p>Your payment has been successfully received.</p>
      <p>Your payment details are provided below.</p>

      <h3 class="section-title">Payment Details</h3>

      <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px">
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold">Course:</td>
          <td style="padding: 8px 0"><%= courseName %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold">Amount Paid:</td>
          <td style="padding: 8px 0">$<%= amount %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold">Stripe ID:</td>
          <td style="padding: 8px 0"><%= stripeID %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold">Date:</td>
          <td style="padding: 8px 0"><%= paymentDate %></td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <p>Your enrollment is now being processed.</p>
      <p>Your official receipt is attached for your records.</p>

      <p>We’re redefining learning with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>AI-driven career pathways</li>
        <li>Micro-credentials</li>
        <li>Personalized upskilling journeys</li>
      </ul>

      <p>You’re now part of the future of learning.</p>

      <h3 class="section-title">🟧 Need Help?</h3>

      <p>
        Simply reply to this email.<br />
        Our support team is here for you — anytime.
      </p>

      <h3 class="section-title">Welcome Aboard</h3>

      <p>
        Welcome to WEL.X.<br />
        Welcome to What’s Next.
      </p>

      <p>
        Warm regards,<br />
        <strong>Team WEL.X</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="footer">
        📧 <a href="mailto:welx@wellingtoncampus.co">welx@wellingtoncampus.co</a
        ><br />
        🌐 <a href="https://www.mywelx.com/">https://www.mywelx.com/</a><br />
        📞 +971542523926<br />
        Dubai CommerCity | Powered by Wellington Campus
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
